"Wait for each point to complete" = "等待每个点完成";
"Waiting for switch" = "等待开关";
"We collect ZERO information. This app does not collect personal information, track usage analytics, send crash reports, connect to external servers, use cookies or tracking technologies, collect advertising identifiers, access your location, or store or transmit camera or microphone data." = "我们收集零信息。不收集个人信息、使用分析、崩溃报告，不连接外部服务器，不使用 Cookie 或广告标识，不访问位置，不存储或传输摄像头或麦克风数据。";
"We share NO data with anyone. This app uses no third-party services — no analytics platforms, no crash reporting, no advertising networks, no cloud services." = "我们不与任何人共享数据。无第三方服务——无分析、崩溃报告、广告网络或云服务。";
"Welcome to Switch2GO" = "欢迎使用 Switch2GO";
"When a phrase with “Send switch output” is selected, the iPad pulses GPIO 26 on the ESP32. Wire that pin through a relay or optocoupler to the PowerLink switch jack." = "选择带“发送开关输出”的语句时，iPad 会向 ESP32 的 GPIO 26 发送脉冲。请将该引脚经继电器或光耦接到 PowerLink 开关口。";
"When editing a phrase's image, you can open the Image Tool — a built-in web tool that helps you find and prepare the perfect picture for any phrase." = "编辑语句图片时，可打开图片工具——内置网页工具，帮你找到并准备合适的图片。";
"When this phrase is selected, pulse the paired ESP32 so a PowerLink can toggle a device (fan, light)." = "选择此语句时，向已配对的 ESP32 发送脉冲，以便 PowerLink 开关设备（风扇、灯）。";
"When you attach a video, audio, or game to a phrase, it starts after a short delay (%@) so another phrase can be selected first. Change this anytime in Settings → Timing & Sensitivity." = "为语句附加视频、音频或游戏后，会在短暂延迟（%@）后开始，以便先选其他语句。可随时在设置 → 时间与灵敏度中更改。";
