"Yes" = "是";
"You can add, edit, reorder, and delete categories and phrases from Settings → Edit Categories & Phrases." = "可在设置 → 编辑类别和语句中添加、编辑、重排和删除类别与语句。";
"You can also add a high-contrast colored outline around the object. Choose from colors like red, yellow, black, white, blue, green, and more, and adjust the outline thickness. This helps the subject stand out clearly." = "还可以给物体加上高对比彩色描边。可选红、黄、黑、白、蓝、绿等，并调整粗细，让主体更突出。";
"You can also assign a specific background color to each symbol position (e.g. red for top-left, blue for top-right). Consistent position colors help users learn where to look." = "还可以给每个符号位置指定背景色（例如左上红色、右上蓝色）。固定的位置颜色帮助用户知道该往哪看。";
"You can switch between modes at any time -- the app will remember your last choice." = "可随时切换模式——应用会记住上次选择。";
"You can use Switch2GO in almost any orientation. The only unsupported position is when the front camera is upside down." = "几乎任何方向都可以使用 Switch2GO。唯一不支持的是前置摄像头朝下倒置。";
